    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<strong>Four rooms... Four nightmares... One escape...</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451340/extras/316665bf4fcf4c09445dec4675c055aa.poster.avif?t=1696884333\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451340/extras/316665bf4fcf4c09445dec4675c055aa.webm?t=1696884333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451340/extras/316665bf4fcf4c09445dec4675c055aa.mp4?t=1696884333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The Nightmare Escape is a thrilling first-person horror game that takes players on an unforgettable journey through the depths of fear and the enigmatic realms of the mind. Unravel the mysteries of an experiment gone wrong that traps Mia Crowe in a coma.  In order to recover, Mia must navigate four of the darkest paths of her mind to escape.  <br><br>Immerse yourself in an anthology of four interconnected nightmares, each offering a unique and chilling experience. You awaken in a dimly lit apartment with no memory of how you arrived there. As you explore the eerie rooms and unlock their secrets, fragmented memories begin to surface, revealing a disturbing truth about your past and the nightmarish circumstances that have trapped you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451340/extras/41581158e72a27c55b6e01aa26d65fd0.poster.avif?t=1696884333\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451340/extras/41581158e72a27c55b6e01aa26d65fd0.webm?t=1696884333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451340/extras/41581158e72a27c55b6e01aa26d65fd0.mp4?t=1696884333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Key Features:<br><br>- A chilling anthology of four unique interconnected nightmares<br>- Atmospheric and immersive first-person horror experience<br>- Intricate puzzles that test your wit and logic<br>- Uncover the dark secrets of the apartment through fragmented memories<br>- Encounter otherworldly entities that lurk in the shadows<br>- Engrossing narrative with psychological twists and revelations<br>- Stunning visuals and haunting audio design that enhance the eerie atmosphere<br>- Unravel the truth behind your own nightmare and find a way to escape",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Four rooms... Four nightmares... One escape...</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451340/extras/316665bf4fcf4c09445dec4675c055aa.poster.avif?t=1696884333\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451340/extras/316665bf4fcf4c09445dec4675c055aa.webm?t=1696884333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451340/extras/316665bf4fcf4c09445dec4675c055aa.mp4?t=1696884333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The Nightmare Escape is a thrilling first-person horror game that takes players on an unforgettable journey through the depths of fear and the enigmatic realms of the mind. Unravel the mysteries of an experiment gone wrong that traps Mia Crowe in a coma.  In order to recover, Mia must navigate four of the darkest paths of her mind to escape.  <br><br>Immerse yourself in an anthology of four interconnected nightmares, each offering a unique and chilling experience. You awaken in a dimly lit apartment with no memory of how you arrived there. As you explore the eerie rooms and unlock their secrets, fragmented memories begin to surface, revealing a disturbing truth about your past and the nightmarish circumstances that have trapped you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451340/extras/41581158e72a27c55b6e01aa26d65fd0.poster.avif?t=1696884333\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451340/extras/41581158e72a27c55b6e01aa26d65fd0.webm?t=1696884333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451340/extras/41581158e72a27c55b6e01aa26d65fd0.mp4?t=1696884333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Key Features:<br><br>- A chilling anthology of four unique interconnected nightmares<br>- Atmospheric and immersive first-person horror experience<br>- Intricate puzzles that test your wit and logic<br>- Uncover the dark secrets of the apartment through fragmented memories<br>- Encounter otherworldly entities that lurk in the shadows<br>- Engrossing narrative with psychological twists and revelations<br>- Stunning visuals and haunting audio design that enhance the eerie atmosphere<br>- Unravel the truth behind your own nightmare and find a way to escape",
